&lt;p&gt;Candidates from the EU should review &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.assemblyai.com/legal/gdpr-job-applicant-and-worker-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;this job applicant privacy notice&lt;/a&gt; before applying.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Keep Exploring AssemblyAI:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.assemblyai.com/products/speech-to-text&quot;&gt;Speech-to-text&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.assemblyai.com/products/streaming-speech-to-text&quot;&gt;Streaming speech-to-text&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.assemblyai.com/products/speech-understanding&quot;&gt;Speech Understanding&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.assemblyai.com/products/llm-gateway&quot;&gt;LLM Gateway&lt;br&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.assemblyai.com/playground/source&quot;&gt;Try the Playground&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.assemblyai.com/blog/announcing-our-50m-series-c-to-build-superhuman-speech-ai-models/&quot;&gt;Our $50M Series C fundraise&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@AssemblyAI&quot;&gt;Check us out on YouTube!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

