&lt;p&gt;You lead with design. Engineering is how you bring that design to life, because you don&#39;t have to hand your vision off to someone else to build it. You care about the details other people skip: interaction states, motion, hierarchy, information density, the difference between a UI that works and one that feels right.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a cross-functional role that requires close partnership with engineering, marketing and sales, and the judgment to move from a rough idea to a polished, shipped experience without waiting for a spec.&lt;/p&gt;
