&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the visual and interaction design of our core product surfaces, then build them in production React and TypeScript&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the bar for UX quality across the product: interaction states, motion, hierarchy, and the details that separate a working interface from one that feels considered&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take rough product ideas and turn them into polished, high-fidelity experiences, prototyping quickly to pressure-test direction before we commit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape and steward our design system and visual language so quality scales as the product grows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner directly with engineering and marketing on direction, not just execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI tooling and agents as a core part of how you work, designing and shipping faster because of it&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
