&lt;li&gt;Deep proficiency in Figma, comfortable moving from low-fidelity exploration to high-fidelity, dev-ready designs and maintaining shared component libraries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid frontend engineering skills, comfortable building production interfaces in modern React and TypeScript&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency with AI-assisted design and development, and a real instinct for building AI-native interfaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort operating with ambiguity and owning outcomes end to end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
